OL,3,GNEWSATheatre to permanently close as 23
OL,4,Ajobs axed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA theatre will close at the end of the
OL,7,Fmonth due to serious financial
OL,8,Fdifficulties, as 23 jobs have been
OL,9,Faxed.
OL,11,FTaunton Brewhouse, which has hosted
OL,12,Fmajor names in music, comedy and
OL,13,Fperformance, will shut on 31 October,
OL,14,Fafter needing to raise about #150,000
OL,15,Fto bridge a funding gap.
OL,17,FAll 23 staff working for the Taunton
OL,18,FTheatre Association, which ran the
OL,19,Fvenue, will be made redundant.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
