OL,3,GNEWSATheatre to permanently close as 23
OL,4,Ajobs axed
OL,5,
OL,6,FVal Hammond, association chair, said
OL,7,Fthe team "did hope that it would be
OL,8,Fpossible to find a way for the
OL,9,FBrewhouse to survive in its current
OL,10,Foperation - but that hasn't proved
OL,11,Fpossible".
